; [[Secret Room]]
* Can contain 2 [[Reward Plate]]s.

; [[Shop]]
* There is a small chance when you bomb the Shopkeeper that they can turn into [[Greed]] and start attacking you.

; [[Super Secret Room]]
* The [[Dark Room]] theme contains 4 [[Nulls]] and 6 [[pill]]s or [[rune]]s instead of 1 [[Black Heart]].
* New themes:
** Burning Basement: 2 [[Bomb Chest]]s, a [[Shopkeeper]], 3 [[TNT]], and [[Fire Place]]s, including [[Red Fire Place]]s.
